// BT-3055: minimal ancestor providing `foo`, sent via `^self foo` inside the
// counted loop in bt3055_child.bt. The self-send is what routes the loop's
// codegen through the map-accumulator (`StateAcc`) path instead of the
// tuple-acc or direct-params optimizations (see `BodyEffects::has_self_sends`
// in `crates/beamtalk-core/src/codegen/core_erlang/control_flow/mod.rs`).

Object subclass: BT3055Ancestor

  class foo => #FromAncestor
